Description: All-in-One Wildberries SDK, CLI & MCP Server
 Pure-Python SDK combining direct wbbasket.ru CDN card extraction,
 dynamic basket-01..65+ upstreams routing, feedbacks1/2 sharding, WB Wallet
 pricing engine, Search Rank Tracker, Smart Review Analyzer (offline & LLM),
 SQLite price tracking, Telegram alerts, Excel/CSV/JSON export, 11-command CLI
 (wb-parser / wb-sdk), and 8-tool MCP Server (wb-mcp). Desktop GUI (wb-gui)
 requires optional customtkinter/Pillow via pip/uv extra [gui].
